        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: The Coca-Cola Company, Pepsi-Cola company\n- Products: Mello Yello\n- Brands: the soft drink that Mello Yello competed with, the orange juice producer founded by Anthony T. Rossi and Vincenzo Rossi\n- People: Anthony T. Rossi, Vincenzo Rossi\n\nFacts:\n- The Coca-Cola Company introduced Mello Yello to compete with a soft drink that is owned by the Pepsi-Cola company.\n- Anthony T. Rossi and his son Vincenzo founded an orange juice producer.\n- The orange juice producer founded by Anthony T. Rossi and Vincenzo is owned by the Pepsi-Cola company.",
